WEBVTT

00:52.427 --> 00:53.428
Here, take it.

00:55.221 --> 00:57.182
- What?
- You told me not to ride it.

00:58.308 --> 00:59.851
Are they dating?

01:00.894 --> 01:02.312
Starting today,

01:03.063 --> 01:04.230
I'll only listen to you.

01:09.235 --> 01:11.112
What was that? Was that a confession?

01:11.196 --> 01:13.323
Does Seo-jun like Ju-kyung?

01:13.907 --> 01:14.908
That's huge.

01:15.909 --> 01:17.160
Hey, Seo-jun!

01:17.243 --> 01:18.536
Don't go.

01:22.332 --> 01:24.250
- Just a--
- I said, don't go.

01:38.097 --> 01:38.932
Why?

01:40.558 --> 01:41.684
I have something to say.

01:42.685 --> 01:43.812
Something to say?

01:44.979 --> 01:46.564
About what?

01:49.609 --> 01:50.485
Well…

01:52.070 --> 01:53.113
Well?

01:53.988 --> 01:57.450
The wildfires in Australia are caused
by the Indian Ocean Dipole and El Niño.

01:57.534 --> 01:59.452
What do you think about
their interrelationship?

02:00.245 --> 02:02.330
Niño what now?

02:03.790 --> 02:05.500
- Here.
- Pass it.

02:07.168 --> 02:08.086
Hey.

02:13.341 --> 02:15.385
Take this back.
Why would you give it to me?

02:16.219 --> 02:19.139
You should hold on to it
so I don't ride the motorcycle.

02:19.222 --> 02:20.056
Why?

02:20.140 --> 02:21.850
Because I'll only listen to you.

02:21.933 --> 02:22.767
- What?
- What?

02:23.643 --> 02:25.145
Are you trying to get back at me

02:25.228 --> 02:27.689
for blackmailing you
with the photo of you and the motorcycle?

02:28.189 --> 02:30.191
Get back at you? Please.

02:34.904 --> 02:37.282
I found this on the way here.
You can have it.

02:38.158 --> 02:39.659
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

02:40.577 --> 02:41.619
I prefer strawberry.

02:47.667 --> 02:49.961
Limju, what's up with him all of a sudden?

02:50.044 --> 02:51.588
What's with the motorcycle key?

03:02.640 --> 03:03.516
Seo-jun.

03:05.643 --> 03:07.812
- What's with you two?
- There she is!

03:08.563 --> 03:09.439
Catch it.

03:15.236 --> 03:16.946
- Hey, what's going on?
- What is it?

03:17.030 --> 03:19.991
- What's that?
- Hey, what is it?

03:20.074 --> 03:22.702
- See this?
- That's awesome.

03:22.785 --> 03:24.662
- Watch this, look.
- Hey, Si-hyun.

03:24.746 --> 03:26.706
You're so bad at it. Go home and practice.

03:26.789 --> 03:28.499
Can we have lunch later--

03:30.460 --> 03:31.419
Enjoy your lunch.

03:32.587 --> 03:33.796
- What's up with him?
- Look.

03:36.966 --> 03:39.010
When did he put this in here?

03:44.307 --> 03:45.350
You can sit here if you want.

03:51.481 --> 03:52.523
Thanks.

04:04.077 --> 04:06.913
- You said you weren't drinking it.
- I can't just throw it away.

04:06.996 --> 04:08.248
- Here, have this.
- What…

04:16.881 --> 04:19.717
All right. Take a seat, everyone.

04:19.801 --> 04:20.635
- Okay.
- Yes.

04:22.971 --> 04:24.514
I'm going to do a roll call.

04:24.597 --> 04:25.723
- Yes.
- Yes.

04:25.807 --> 04:27.850
- Kim Si-hyun.
- Present.

04:27.934 --> 04:30.186
- Kim Ji-eun.
- Present.

04:30.270 --> 04:32.522
- Kim Eun-sol.
- Present.

04:32.605 --> 04:34.524
- Kim Seo-won.
- Present.

04:34.607 --> 04:36.609
- Ha Ji-young.
- Present.

04:36.693 --> 04:38.820
- Kim Ju-won.
- Present.

04:38.903 --> 04:40.905
- Kim Su-jin.
- Present.

04:40.989 --> 04:42.407
- Park Jun-young.
- Present.

04:42.490 --> 04:45.618
When organic matter
is decomposed by enzymes,

04:45.702 --> 04:46.995
inorganic matter is created,

04:47.078 --> 04:49.998
and energy is produced during the process.

04:50.081 --> 04:53.501
Some of the energy is converted into ATP,

04:53.584 --> 04:56.879
and the rest is released
as thermal energy.

04:57.547 --> 05:02.135
That's when cellular respiration occurs.

05:24.907 --> 05:25.825
Did he bring this

05:26.617 --> 05:29.162
because I said I liked strawberry?

05:33.416 --> 05:37.128
During the day, the light energy is stored

05:37.211 --> 05:39.964
so that it can be used when needed.

05:40.048 --> 05:41.507
Let's look at the next page.

05:41.591 --> 05:43.217
Ju-kyung, let me sit next to you.

05:45.011 --> 05:46.262
How could you?

05:46.345 --> 05:47.722
Seo-jun, seriously?

05:49.015 --> 05:49.849
You're annoying.

05:49.932 --> 05:52.977
Seo-jun, go away if you're here
to give her a hard time.

05:53.644 --> 05:55.354
I'm only going to listen to Ju-kyung.

05:55.438 --> 05:58.900
- "Only going to listen to her."
- "Only going to listen to her."

06:00.443 --> 06:01.360
Then,

06:02.070 --> 06:03.154
can you do me a favor?

06:05.406 --> 06:06.574
Of course.

06:07.658 --> 06:09.202
Can you get lost?

06:09.827 --> 06:10.661
What?

06:12.955 --> 06:14.624
I'll do anything other than that.

06:14.707 --> 06:17.585
- "I'll do anything."
- "I'll do anything."

06:19.212 --> 06:20.838
Then can you not talk to me?

06:22.381 --> 06:23.257
Not that either.

06:24.175 --> 06:26.052
What are you even saying?

06:30.098 --> 06:31.224
You don't like this one?

06:35.311 --> 06:37.021
That's my favorite side dish!

06:37.730 --> 06:39.232
I was saving that for last!

06:39.315 --> 06:40.525
Why would you do that?

06:40.608 --> 06:42.401
Why do you care about how I eat?

06:45.196 --> 06:46.739
I'll only listen to you.

06:46.823 --> 06:49.534
Hey, bring the pork cutlets.

06:49.617 --> 06:51.452
- "Pork cutlets."
- "Pork cutlets."

06:52.662 --> 06:54.163
Ta-da!

06:57.750 --> 06:59.710
You want me to eat all of these?

06:59.794 --> 07:01.045
Yes.

07:02.046 --> 07:04.132
Is this a crush or a crash? I can't tell.

07:04.215 --> 07:06.884
You need to eat more
to grow taller, right?

07:11.514 --> 07:13.224
Don't eat your hair, though.

07:17.437 --> 07:19.272
What a gentleman.

07:26.154 --> 07:28.781
Just take your key.
Don't sneak it into my pocket again.

07:28.865 --> 07:30.408
What would I do with it, though…

07:31.659 --> 07:34.620
when my motorcycle is parked
in front of your place.

07:38.166 --> 07:39.459
- Gosh.
- That's disgusting.

07:40.543 --> 07:43.296
- Hey.
- Look at Seo-jun's face.

07:43.379 --> 07:45.590
- I'm okay.
- Are you crazy?

07:45.673 --> 07:46.799
Great job, Ju-kyung.

07:46.883 --> 07:47.717
What now?

07:48.384 --> 07:51.053
Hey, I'm really sorry.

07:51.137 --> 07:53.014
- You find this funny?
- I can't believe it.

08:00.605 --> 08:02.148
Ju-kyung!

08:02.231 --> 08:03.441
You have such a long tail.

08:08.905 --> 08:09.947
Like a long-tailed monkey!

08:10.031 --> 08:12.950
- Don't make fun of me.
- Of course, I'll listen to you.

08:26.839 --> 08:29.717
- What are you doing?
- You two are so cute.

08:34.972 --> 08:37.308
- Hey!
- Why did you catch me?

08:37.391 --> 08:38.684
I fell because of you.

08:38.768 --> 08:41.229
- I saved you!
- I don't need you to save me.

08:41.312 --> 08:44.941
And please just listen to me
and take back your motorcycle key.

08:47.068 --> 08:49.487
Can't I just attend school in peace?

08:50.613 --> 08:51.489
Are you all right?

08:53.741 --> 08:54.617
Yes.

08:56.786 --> 08:58.746
- What were you thinking?
- She dumped you.

08:58.829 --> 09:00.373
- She's into me!
- Let's get him out.

09:00.456 --> 09:02.208
- I'm Han Seo-jun!
- We know, it's okay.

09:02.291 --> 09:06.128
- To the countless hands
- To the countless hands

09:06.212 --> 09:10.716
- That have uplifted me
- That have uplifted me

09:11.425 --> 09:17.807
- Like the sun that illuminates me
- Like the sun that illuminates me

09:18.849 --> 09:21.894
- Become
- Become

09:22.395 --> 09:27.817
- A light
- A light

09:28.859 --> 09:30.152
Brava!

09:31.153 --> 09:32.154
Brava.

09:32.238 --> 09:36.033
I thought Maria Callas
came back from the grave.

09:36.659 --> 09:41.539
Go-un's voice is such a pleasure
to the ears, isn't it?

09:43.165 --> 09:45.543
Congratulazioni.

09:49.046 --> 09:52.717
The solo part goes to you, Han Go-un.

09:54.093 --> 09:58.848
Like a lone flower blossoming

09:58.931 --> 10:03.436
In a wide open field

10:03.519 --> 10:08.983
- I've protected the feeling of emptiness…
- She's so good at singing.

10:10.693 --> 10:11.777
Get out.

10:15.197 --> 10:16.115
Hey.

10:17.033 --> 10:19.160
Didn't I tell you not to give it your all?

10:24.915 --> 10:28.878
You're not actually thinking about
taking the solo part, are you?

10:29.420 --> 10:32.965
Go tell the director right now
that you can't do it.

10:40.806 --> 10:42.016
Those mean girls.

10:42.975 --> 10:44.518
How could she slap a classmate?

11:12.254 --> 11:13.839
Do you have tutoring today?

11:13.923 --> 11:15.674
Yes. Two sessions at that.

11:16.592 --> 11:17.718
That's impressive.

11:19.762 --> 11:22.723
- What's wrong with your hands?
- What about them?

11:22.807 --> 11:25.267
Your hands are all cracked
when it's not even winter.

11:25.935 --> 11:26.977
Hold on.

11:28.270 --> 11:29.480
Give me your hands.

11:32.775 --> 11:35.403
Your skin is amazing.
It should be the same for your hands.

11:35.986 --> 11:36.904
What's this for?

11:36.987 --> 11:39.365
You know my mom owns a beauty shop, right?

11:40.449 --> 11:41.575
All done.

11:43.077 --> 11:44.537
How is it? Smells nice, right?

11:45.871 --> 11:47.498
Yes, it does.

11:55.589 --> 11:57.508
What? Hey.

12:13.983 --> 12:14.900
Amazing.

12:17.027 --> 12:18.654
You are really something.

12:22.408 --> 12:24.535
Right. Thought you were someone I knew.

12:26.162 --> 12:27.621
Hey, really sorry.

12:27.705 --> 12:29.081
Does she not recognize me?

12:29.165 --> 12:30.124
By the way,

12:30.749 --> 12:31.584
you…

12:32.168 --> 12:34.462
Let's go. Sir, we're getting off here!

12:38.340 --> 12:40.092
Step aside so we can get off.

12:47.683 --> 12:49.518
What was that? Rude!

12:49.602 --> 12:50.561
Who is she?

12:50.644 --> 12:51.645
I don't know.

12:51.729 --> 12:55.274
I follow her on social media.
I thought I knew her for a second.

12:55.357 --> 12:59.111
- That could've been embarrassing.
- But that girl was so rude. What the hell?

13:04.700 --> 13:06.368
Why were you so terrified?

13:06.994 --> 13:08.704
- Do you know them?
- What?

13:11.165 --> 13:11.999
Well…

13:15.211 --> 13:17.796
They just seemed like delinquents.

13:18.672 --> 13:20.591
Hey, don't be scared of them.

13:20.674 --> 13:22.968
They act meaner
if they know you're scared.

13:23.052 --> 13:24.595
Be brave next time, okay?

14:59.773 --> 15:00.608
What?

15:00.691 --> 15:02.151
"I'll only listen to you"?

15:12.620 --> 15:15.164
I should have left Seoul.

15:19.376 --> 15:21.128
I made a promise to myself.

15:21.211 --> 15:23.464
As long as I have you within my sight,

15:25.174 --> 15:26.675
I'll protect you.

15:30.471 --> 15:31.931
What are you doing, you brat?

15:34.391 --> 15:35.392
Woman!

15:35.476 --> 15:37.478
Do you want to revolutionize
the order of your ribs?

15:38.187 --> 15:41.607
Get off unless you want
a crash landing in hell.

15:41.690 --> 15:43.609
- Come on.
- Careful. This is expensive.

15:43.692 --> 15:46.278
What is he thinking, parking this here?

15:50.199 --> 15:51.492
What are you doing?

15:57.790 --> 15:58.749
Are you asleep?

16:01.543 --> 16:02.419
LIM JU-KYUNG

16:22.147 --> 16:23.524
Good grief.

16:26.902 --> 16:29.113
Hey, come out already.

16:29.655 --> 16:32.449
She takes her sweet time
removing her thick makeup.

16:33.033 --> 16:34.034
Hello?

16:34.827 --> 16:36.161
Isn't this Ju-kyung's number?

16:36.245 --> 16:37.788
She's in the shower.

16:38.497 --> 16:39.498
Who are you?

16:39.581 --> 16:40.833
The person showering next.

16:42.334 --> 16:44.378
Goodness, Ju-young.

16:44.461 --> 16:46.672
I told you to flush after you pee.

16:46.755 --> 16:48.924
And turn the fan on when you poop.

16:49.008 --> 16:51.343
Who are you to tell me
how to pee and poop?

16:51.427 --> 16:53.178
Seriously, watch your mouth.

16:53.762 --> 16:56.140
What are you doing?
Why did you answer my phone?

16:56.890 --> 16:57.975
LEE SOO-HO

16:59.309 --> 17:00.352
Lee Soo-ho?

17:24.960 --> 17:28.547
LEE SOO-HO

17:35.471 --> 17:37.765
LIM JU-KYUNG

17:42.186 --> 17:43.020
Hey.

17:45.230 --> 17:47.149
I hung up by accident.

17:48.150 --> 17:51.653
- Was that your younger brother?
- Yes. My younger brother.

17:52.738 --> 17:53.614
- But why--
- Well--

17:54.782 --> 17:55.908
Sorry. You go first.

17:56.492 --> 17:57.367
Want to meet up?

17:58.202 --> 18:00.204
- Right now?
- I need my jacket back anyway.

18:03.707 --> 18:04.541
Your jacket.

18:05.292 --> 18:06.752
Yes, I'll be right out.

18:07.294 --> 18:08.796
I'll see you at the playground.

18:17.471 --> 18:19.223
I got goosebumps.

18:28.273 --> 18:29.274
What?

18:47.793 --> 18:48.961
Were you waiting long?

18:49.628 --> 18:50.462
No.

18:57.469 --> 19:00.139
He seems to like you.
He was feisty towards me.

19:00.222 --> 19:02.766
Yes, this cat has a temper.

19:02.850 --> 19:04.226
He's incredibly wary,

19:04.309 --> 19:07.437
but I fed him daily and groveled
to earn his special treatment.

19:08.313 --> 19:09.565
Even to a cat.

19:10.941 --> 19:12.359
You meddle in everything.

19:14.111 --> 19:14.987
Still,

19:15.612 --> 19:18.073
it's sad that he's alone
because he's cold to everyone.

19:20.742 --> 19:21.910
That sounds like me.

19:27.082 --> 19:28.709
So you know you're cold.

19:31.170 --> 19:33.755
At least you have your family.
But the cat…

19:34.548 --> 19:35.924
I don't have a family.

19:40.429 --> 19:42.514
Do you live alone then?

19:43.098 --> 19:44.683
Yes, I do.

19:45.350 --> 19:46.852
Then do you cook at…

19:49.813 --> 19:52.274
I'm sorry. It's none of my business.

19:53.275 --> 19:54.318
It's okay.

19:55.110 --> 19:56.528
Why did you put makeup on?

19:58.238 --> 20:00.115
- What?
- Earlier…

20:02.451 --> 20:03.285
Well…

20:04.411 --> 20:06.038
your brother said you showered.

20:09.291 --> 20:13.545
I always shower right before I go to bed.
I'll do it when I get home.

20:14.213 --> 20:15.255
I see.

20:16.465 --> 20:18.884
Did you come all the way here
just to get your jacket?

20:20.052 --> 20:20.928
Of course.

20:22.304 --> 20:25.390
What other reason would I have
other than just to get my jacket?

20:26.141 --> 20:27.059
Right.

20:27.142 --> 20:28.393
It's my favorite one.

20:29.061 --> 20:30.062
I'm very attached to it.

20:30.729 --> 20:31.563
Really?

20:32.689 --> 20:33.565
Hey,

20:34.399 --> 20:36.693
I'm really, truly, sorry.

20:36.777 --> 20:39.029
But the jacket isn't quite dry yet.

20:40.697 --> 20:43.200
You came all the way out here to get it.

20:44.076 --> 20:45.160
Well, can't be helped.

20:46.161 --> 20:47.329
Thanks for understanding.

20:47.412 --> 20:49.706
I'll treat you to something nice
next time instead.

20:56.129 --> 20:58.757
Okay, then. Bye.

21:03.553 --> 21:04.388
Hey.

21:06.265 --> 21:07.099
Yes?

21:08.141 --> 21:09.226
There's a basketball.

21:21.113 --> 21:21.947
It's nothing.

21:24.116 --> 21:25.534
I didn't expect that.

21:25.617 --> 21:27.953
You look like you'd spend
all of your time studying.

21:30.205 --> 21:31.748
Can you make a shot?

21:43.677 --> 21:45.345
- It's flat, that's why.
- You sure?

21:48.515 --> 21:49.933
Awesome!

21:50.017 --> 21:50.976
Did you see that?

21:51.518 --> 21:53.312
Hey, watch this.

21:53.812 --> 21:55.022
The left hand only guides.

21:55.105 --> 21:56.898
You were using your left hand too much.

21:57.566 --> 21:58.984
Like so.

22:01.403 --> 22:03.322
I was captain of the varsity team
until last year.

22:03.405 --> 22:05.657
Then why aren't you playing
in the next game?

22:06.241 --> 22:08.327
- Just because.
- Did you get cut from the team?

22:08.410 --> 22:09.745
Because you couldn't make shots.

22:10.537 --> 22:12.789
The left hand only guides. Like so.

22:12.873 --> 22:14.082
Enough with the left hand.

22:14.583 --> 22:16.335
You'd faint if you saw me play a game.

22:18.086 --> 22:19.296
What did I say?

22:20.630 --> 22:22.174
I said it just guides.

23:11.973 --> 23:12.808
Well…

23:14.726 --> 23:15.560
How was it?

23:15.644 --> 23:16.520
What--

23:17.104 --> 23:18.897
What do you mean? The hug--

23:18.980 --> 23:20.148
The scent.

23:21.233 --> 23:23.318
I got a new laundry detergent yesterday.

23:24.194 --> 23:25.028
Laundry detergent?

23:25.612 --> 23:27.906
The ad said the scent lasts,
even after a workout.

23:28.865 --> 23:29.908
I just wanted to check.

23:31.243 --> 23:34.246
Yes. It smelled amazing.

23:36.581 --> 23:38.834
But why is your face…

23:50.512 --> 23:51.555
It's you guys again.

23:59.312 --> 24:00.564
What are you doing?

24:00.647 --> 24:01.731
How's the scent?

24:02.566 --> 24:03.608
I got a new detergent.

24:03.692 --> 24:04.901
Is it citrus?

24:09.739 --> 24:10.699
It's fresh and nice.

24:10.782 --> 24:11.867
Is that so?

24:14.744 --> 24:16.705
Yes, this one's good. Is it an import?

24:18.039 --> 24:18.957
Hold still.

24:23.003 --> 24:23.837
Sir…

24:26.840 --> 24:29.467
My heart skipped a beat
while checking the scent.

24:29.551 --> 24:31.887
You idiot.
What kind of excuse is laundry detergent?

24:32.387 --> 24:33.597
Hey, by the way,

24:34.764 --> 24:36.516
you don't have to walk me home.

24:37.976 --> 24:39.853
The bus stop is closer on the other side.

24:43.023 --> 24:43.940
I thought…

25:11.092 --> 25:12.010
We're here.

25:12.802 --> 25:14.638
Yes, we are.

25:16.014 --> 25:19.726
Then, I'll go inside now. Bye.

25:20.769 --> 25:22.062
You should give it to me.

25:23.939 --> 25:24.856
Your jacket?

25:25.523 --> 25:27.025
It's not dry yet.

25:27.525 --> 25:29.277
No, the motorcycle key.

25:30.654 --> 25:31.696
I'll return it to him.

25:32.572 --> 25:33.782
No. I'll give him the key.

25:34.449 --> 25:35.700
What if you fight again?

25:35.784 --> 25:38.078
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

25:45.710 --> 25:47.170
Has he returned the key already?

25:49.089 --> 25:51.091
They better not have had another fight.

25:53.760 --> 25:55.178
Good.

25:57.055 --> 25:57.889
Nice.

25:58.473 --> 25:59.474
Soo-ho,

25:59.557 --> 26:02.143
I saw that Seo-jun
took the motorcycle right away.

26:02.811 --> 26:03.728
Did he?

26:06.481 --> 26:08.149
- That was good.
- Nice.

26:08.233 --> 26:09.567
- Not bad.
- Over here.

26:14.239 --> 26:15.657
You hug very well.

26:16.533 --> 26:18.660
- What?
- What?

26:19.828 --> 26:21.579
I mean, you receive it well.

26:21.663 --> 26:23.665
The ball.

26:25.625 --> 26:27.502
Do you see this?

26:27.585 --> 26:29.546
Does that look like a basketball to you?

26:29.629 --> 26:31.423
What a show from the worst on the team.

26:31.506 --> 26:33.174
We'll see how it goes in the match.

26:33.258 --> 26:34.634
We, the Saebom Devils,

26:34.718 --> 26:37.262
will crush the class basketball club
made up of nobodies.

26:37.345 --> 26:39.180
- "Nobodies"?
- I meant you.

26:40.098 --> 26:42.600
Our Savior Soo-ho will play again!

26:42.684 --> 26:45.103
What? Soo-ho's going to play?

26:45.186 --> 26:47.522
- Why is he playing all of a sudden?
- Really?

26:50.150 --> 26:51.735
I guess he's playing in the game.

26:51.818 --> 26:53.903
Who's going to block that giant?

26:56.698 --> 26:59.284
Seo-jun, you're good at basketball, right?

27:01.536 --> 27:02.495
What?

27:02.579 --> 27:03.413
Why?

27:03.496 --> 27:05.790
- Do I seem like I'd be good at it?
- Yes.

27:05.874 --> 27:07.459
I'm super good.

27:07.542 --> 27:08.918
You're super good, right?

27:09.002 --> 27:10.462
Then for the festival,

27:10.545 --> 27:13.923
can you join our team
and show off your super good skills?

27:15.216 --> 27:16.051
Then…

27:17.469 --> 27:19.054
I'll have to ask Ju-kyung first.

27:21.097 --> 27:22.849
Lately, I only listen to her.

27:24.309 --> 27:26.811
- He only listens to her!
- He only listens to her!

27:28.730 --> 27:30.732
Ju-kyung, do you want to see me play?

27:30.815 --> 27:32.150
No, not at all.

27:33.651 --> 27:34.903
Not at all?

27:35.403 --> 27:39.282
Please, Ju-kyung. Tell him to play.
I really don't want to lose to Tae-hoon.

27:41.576 --> 27:43.495
Whatever. I don't care.

27:44.079 --> 27:45.955
If it's what you want, I'll do it.

27:46.539 --> 27:47.499
I'll play.

27:48.917 --> 27:49.918
Thank you so much.

27:51.086 --> 27:52.670
It's just like this.

27:55.215 --> 27:56.925
- This way, sir.
- This is it, right?

27:57.008 --> 27:58.218
Yes, this way.

27:58.843 --> 28:00.178
You watch your mouth.

28:00.804 --> 28:02.555
He really might be into you.

28:02.639 --> 28:04.516
He can't be doing all that for a photo.

28:05.141 --> 28:07.310
Whether he likes her
or is messing with her,

28:07.394 --> 28:08.686
he's so childish.

28:10.313 --> 28:12.774
I can never figure Soo-ho out.

28:12.857 --> 28:14.526
Look, he's playing volleyball alone.

28:14.609 --> 28:16.361
- It's handball.
- Right.

28:17.570 --> 28:18.571
Look.

28:20.407 --> 28:21.658
It's seriously too hot.

28:22.283 --> 28:23.868
She's like a lottery ticket.

28:24.494 --> 28:26.287
My speculations never turn out right.

28:28.665 --> 28:29.582
Hello?

28:30.542 --> 28:32.043
Yes, that's me.

28:33.211 --> 28:34.879
What? Being towed?

28:36.548 --> 28:38.091
What did you do now, Ju-kyung?

28:38.883 --> 28:40.385
Hey, Ju-kyung!

28:46.307 --> 28:47.559
What was that for?

28:47.642 --> 28:49.227
It's your turn to tidy things up.

28:51.646 --> 28:53.106
So immature.

28:54.941 --> 28:57.110
- Don't you want your motorcycle back?
- I see.

28:57.986 --> 28:59.446
It was you who reported it then?

29:00.155 --> 29:02.741
- You must have lost it.
- Just so you know, I have the key.

29:10.498 --> 29:12.751
Hey, people from other schools
will be there too.

29:12.834 --> 29:15.670
What will they think of our choir
if they see you doing the solo?

29:15.754 --> 29:17.547
Why shouldn't I do the solo?

29:18.214 --> 29:19.758
You still don't get it, do you?

29:19.841 --> 29:22.427
You can't because you're ugly, you hag.

29:28.016 --> 29:29.768
What the heck? That's the rag water.

29:29.851 --> 29:30.935
What the hell?

29:31.019 --> 29:33.271
Your language is foul,
so I figured it needed cleaning.

29:33.354 --> 29:35.231
Who are you to say such things to her?

29:35.815 --> 29:39.110
What's the use of a pretty face
when your mind is filthy and disgusting?

29:39.194 --> 29:40.111
Aren't you a junior?

29:40.195 --> 29:42.697
Who are you to get involved
and make a fuss?

29:42.781 --> 29:43.823
Me?

29:48.870 --> 29:51.581
I'm her older sister. What now?

29:54.375 --> 29:55.460
Go-un!

29:57.462 --> 29:59.214
Who was that crazy psycho?

29:59.964 --> 30:02.592
- What did you just call her?
- Who is this now?

30:09.808 --> 30:10.642
I missed.

30:11.601 --> 30:15.480
If I catch you doing this again,
your noses will need fixing.

30:28.326 --> 30:30.453
Because you are ugly.

30:45.677 --> 30:46.678
Here.

30:53.309 --> 30:54.644
Like they said,

30:56.229 --> 30:59.190
do you think only certain people
should get to perform on a stage?

30:59.274 --> 31:00.483
Not at all.

31:01.109 --> 31:02.944
You were chosen because you did great.

31:03.820 --> 31:06.030
I heard you singing the other day too.

31:06.114 --> 31:08.950
I thought that being talented
would be enough,

31:10.451 --> 31:12.871
but if the audience laughs at my face,
just like them…

31:14.789 --> 31:18.084
I'm scared my face will turn my voice

31:18.710 --> 31:19.919
into a joke as well.

31:20.003 --> 31:23.131
They're the ones in the wrong.
You shouldn't have to give up anything.

31:23.631 --> 31:25.967
Don't run away because you're scared.

31:27.802 --> 31:29.470
But you're pretty,

31:31.097 --> 31:32.807
so you wouldn't know how I feel.

31:34.642 --> 31:35.476
You're wrong.

31:36.269 --> 31:37.395
In fact,

31:38.146 --> 31:39.939
I know better than anyone else.

31:48.239 --> 31:50.700
One thing to remember
when applying eyeshadow.

31:50.783 --> 31:53.786
Apply makeup to the inner
and outer corners of your eyes…

31:53.870 --> 31:57.248
This would work well for Go-un.

31:57.332 --> 32:01.586
This way, your eyes will look bigger.
The base color…

32:01.669 --> 32:02.795
Like so…

32:04.756 --> 32:06.591
- What are you watching?
- What?

32:07.634 --> 32:08.927
It's a makeup tutorial.

32:10.803 --> 32:13.723
Well, there's this girl I came across.

32:13.806 --> 32:15.350
I found her situation to be…

32:16.017 --> 32:17.560
unfortunate.

32:17.644 --> 32:19.854
I was wondering what I could do to help.

32:20.688 --> 32:21.689
You're meddling again.

32:23.274 --> 32:24.484
Right.

32:24.567 --> 32:25.860
I'm being meddlesome.

32:26.444 --> 32:27.737
But that kind of meddling

32:27.820 --> 32:30.073
could provide support
to someone who needs it.

32:32.492 --> 32:33.576
To be honest,

32:34.577 --> 32:36.788
she reminded me of my old self.

32:38.539 --> 32:40.416
That must be why I feel drawn to her.

32:41.501 --> 32:44.045
I look worse than her without makeup,
of course.

32:45.964 --> 32:48.216
- That's not true.
- Sorry?

32:48.299 --> 32:49.968
You look pretty even without makeup.

32:57.225 --> 32:59.394
- The bus will arrive shortly.
- The bus is here.

33:00.228 --> 33:01.229
Okay.

33:23.251 --> 33:24.502
No way.

33:25.920 --> 33:27.839
It can't be.

33:31.509 --> 33:32.343
LOVE COUNSELING

33:32.427 --> 33:36.014
Hey guys. A guy hugged me,
asked how his new detergent smelled,

33:36.097 --> 33:37.765
and told me I'm pretty.

33:37.849 --> 33:38.933
What does that mean?

33:39.017 --> 33:41.269
He likes you.
The detergent's an excuse for a hug.

33:41.352 --> 33:42.520
He 100 percent likes you.

33:42.603 --> 33:44.814
The detergent thing sounds fishy.
Is he a player?

33:44.897 --> 33:45.815
Ask him out.

33:45.898 --> 33:48.693
Men never spend their time or money
if they're not interested.

33:48.776 --> 33:49.736
Ask him out?

33:51.904 --> 33:54.866
I can't. I could never.

33:59.662 --> 34:01.039
LEE SOO-HO

34:07.170 --> 34:09.338
Why do my words come out
with no filter anymore?

34:20.141 --> 34:21.934
Are you heading home okay?

34:22.018 --> 34:23.394
My sister

34:23.478 --> 34:26.064
gave me free movie tickets.

34:26.981 --> 34:29.192
If you have time

34:29.275 --> 34:30.735
after the festival tomorrow,

34:30.818 --> 34:31.861
do you…

34:32.570 --> 34:33.821
want to go watch a movie?

34:38.826 --> 34:39.911
READ

34:40.536 --> 34:41.621
He read them.

34:57.804 --> 34:59.764
Sure, let's do that.

35:01.641 --> 35:02.934
Goodness.

35:04.310 --> 35:06.229
- That scared me.
- What is she doing?

35:10.066 --> 35:11.234
No way.

35:13.778 --> 35:15.363
Lee Soo-ho likes me?

35:18.407 --> 35:19.951
My gosh.

35:20.535 --> 35:21.661
What do I do?

35:37.802 --> 35:39.428
So what should we watch?

35:41.639 --> 35:43.307
Is there anything you want to watch?

35:45.726 --> 35:47.145
How about a horror movie?

36:12.253 --> 36:13.838
I'LL SEE YOU…

36:13.921 --> 36:16.007
HAN SEO-JUN

36:19.302 --> 36:21.429
Soo-ho, where are you?

36:25.433 --> 36:26.893
You pulled a weird stunt, Soo-ho.

36:31.105 --> 36:31.939
Give me my key.

36:35.735 --> 36:37.153
I like Lim Ju-kyung.

36:37.987 --> 36:38.863
So?

36:39.447 --> 36:40.448
Should I congratulate you?

36:41.032 --> 36:42.575
Don't use her because of me.

36:43.576 --> 36:44.785
What if I'm not using her?

36:45.828 --> 36:47.163
Then you mean it's for real?

36:47.830 --> 36:48.664
Why?

36:49.207 --> 36:50.750
Are you worried I might take her from you?

36:55.421 --> 36:56.631
Mr. Han Jun-woo.

36:58.424 --> 36:59.592
Hello.

37:00.218 --> 37:02.553
What brings you here?

37:02.637 --> 37:04.972
- I'm here to collect my money.
- Excuse me?

37:05.723 --> 37:08.309
You offered compensation.
I came to collect it myself.

37:09.268 --> 37:10.519
Right.

37:10.603 --> 37:12.855
Of course, I will give…

37:14.232 --> 37:15.066
Well,

37:15.149 --> 37:16.734
I don't have any cash right now.

37:17.401 --> 37:18.819
How much were you considering?

37:20.071 --> 37:22.698
I'll use the money
you were going to pay me

37:22.782 --> 37:23.991
to buy your time.

37:31.832 --> 37:33.125
The sun's gone down.

37:34.669 --> 37:36.754
What do you want to do for two hours?

37:39.382 --> 37:40.216
So…

37:41.217 --> 37:43.052
you said you work at Move Entertainment?

37:44.553 --> 37:45.388
I did.

37:45.471 --> 37:47.014
That's really amazing.

37:47.598 --> 37:48.724
Well, I mean.

37:48.808 --> 37:50.059
I don't know much,

37:50.142 --> 37:53.020
but some of my students
dream of becoming singers,

37:53.104 --> 37:55.564
so I know that being
a part of the industry isn't easy.

37:56.107 --> 37:59.068
Have you always wanted
to work in the entertainment industry?

37:59.652 --> 38:01.445
I've never gotten that question before.

38:01.946 --> 38:03.990
I usually get,
"Who have you met in person?"

38:04.073 --> 38:05.908
or "Is that rumor true?" and such.

38:05.992 --> 38:08.744
I feel like I get to know
a person a little better

38:09.495 --> 38:11.664
through the dreams that they've had.

38:14.375 --> 38:15.710
Are you the Little Prince?

38:16.627 --> 38:17.461
I'm not.

38:18.713 --> 38:20.798
You have a rare innocence about you.

38:20.881 --> 38:23.009
- Here are the dishes you ordered.
- Thank you.

38:27.763 --> 38:29.432
Didn't you order an oil-based pasta?

38:29.515 --> 38:31.976
I'm sorry. I'll get it prepared again.

38:32.059 --> 38:34.353
That's okay. I can just have this.

38:35.938 --> 38:37.148
It looks good.

38:37.231 --> 38:39.400
It actually looks better
than the one I ordered.

38:39.483 --> 38:41.444
Thank you. Enjoy your food.

38:41.527 --> 38:42.445
Thank you.

38:43.279 --> 38:44.363
Please, help yourself.

38:57.835 --> 39:00.087
Why did you do that
when you can't eat spicy food?

39:00.171 --> 39:01.839
You should've let her switch it out.

39:02.548 --> 39:04.592
- It's all right.
- What?

39:04.675 --> 39:06.052
The part-timer was so young.

39:08.095 --> 39:09.889
Imagine her embarrassment.

39:14.268 --> 39:16.437
You're quite high-maintenance.

39:19.565 --> 39:20.858
I'm sorry.

39:21.901 --> 39:23.736
I spouted on you.

39:24.487 --> 39:25.321
Your eye…

39:26.739 --> 39:27.740
I'm sorry.

39:27.823 --> 39:28.991
It was a bit spicy…

39:29.742 --> 39:31.577
Playing hard to get isn't in my nature.

39:32.328 --> 39:35.122
I can't put on a mask to chat a guy up.

39:35.790 --> 39:36.957
I'll be frank with you.

39:37.708 --> 39:38.876
I've fallen for you.

39:40.002 --> 39:40.836
Excuse me?

39:41.629 --> 39:43.547
- What?
- Look over there.

39:43.631 --> 39:45.216
- Sure.
- Hey.

39:48.386 --> 39:49.303
Who is that?

39:50.721 --> 39:52.306
Who is she?

39:52.390 --> 39:53.849
What's up with her face?

39:53.933 --> 39:55.684
Why is everyone acting weird?

39:55.768 --> 39:57.228
Is there something on my face?

39:58.354 --> 39:59.772
Who is that?

39:59.855 --> 40:00.689
What the heck?

40:03.109 --> 40:04.026
Oh, no.

40:04.110 --> 40:06.445
Did I come here
without wearing any makeup?

40:11.367 --> 40:12.868
- What is that?
- What's happening?

40:33.514 --> 40:34.390
To me,

40:35.015 --> 40:36.684
even your bare face looks beautiful.

40:56.078 --> 40:57.121
It was a dream.

41:00.166 --> 41:02.501
But a pig in a dream signifies good luck.

41:05.838 --> 41:07.173
How great must my luck be

41:07.256 --> 41:10.050
to have dreamed of not just a pig,
but a pig on a white horse?

41:20.686 --> 41:21.896
She reeks of alcohol.

41:26.817 --> 41:28.402
You're all right, aren't you?

41:29.570 --> 41:32.031
Yes, of course. I'm all right.

41:32.114 --> 41:33.949
Has she lost her mind?

41:38.120 --> 41:39.246
Where's your sister?

41:39.330 --> 41:40.581
She passed out drunk.

41:41.749 --> 41:44.668
She works overtime and has
late-night staff dinners every day.

41:44.752 --> 41:47.796
It'll catch up to her.
Should I get her some herbal medicine?

41:47.880 --> 41:51.258
You're always worrying about the kids.
Take care of yourself too.

41:56.347 --> 41:57.598
- By the way, Dad.
- Yes?

41:57.681 --> 41:59.850
What did you like about Mom
to have married her?

42:00.684 --> 42:01.519
She's pretty.

42:02.353 --> 42:03.270
What?

42:03.354 --> 42:04.230
Seriously?

42:05.856 --> 42:07.608
She looks pretty to you?

42:07.691 --> 42:09.568
Even without any makeup? Look at her now.

42:09.652 --> 42:11.153
Even in her current state?

42:11.237 --> 42:14.406
Are you making fun of your mom
this early in the morning?

42:15.157 --> 42:17.701
It's just that Dad is as handsome
as Prince Charming,

42:17.785 --> 42:20.704
so I wondered why he fell for you
instead of another princess.

42:20.788 --> 42:25.000
To me, your mom was
as beautiful as Snow White.

42:26.293 --> 42:27.294
Seriously?

42:27.378 --> 42:28.462
Not one of the dwarves?

42:28.546 --> 42:29.588
She could be Grumpy.

42:30.506 --> 42:31.632
I'll kill you.

42:33.342 --> 42:35.511
This face isn't pretty at all.

42:50.067 --> 42:52.695
Maybe the contour of my face
has changed a little?

42:54.071 --> 42:56.156
Goodness. I don't know.

42:56.865 --> 42:58.659
THE EIGHTH ANNUAL SAEBOM FESTIVAL

43:12.756 --> 43:13.924
Put more energy into it!

43:14.008 --> 43:16.302
- What?
- What is this?

43:16.385 --> 43:17.511
Did you see this?

43:17.595 --> 43:18.596
What is it?

43:25.644 --> 43:27.563
So this is what a school festival is like.

43:27.646 --> 43:29.189
I missed out last year, so I had no idea.

43:30.983 --> 43:32.651
- Here's a balloon.
- Thank you.

43:32.735 --> 43:33.777
It's my heart.

43:34.528 --> 43:36.739
My girlfriend is here.
My future girlfriend.

43:36.822 --> 43:38.115
Should I ask for her number?

43:43.078 --> 43:45.414
How about we watch Soul Voice?

43:45.998 --> 43:47.333
He's not reading my messages.

43:48.375 --> 43:50.002
Is he still at home?

43:53.339 --> 43:54.590
She looks awful.

43:55.090 --> 43:57.259
- Who is she?
- Look at her makeup.

43:57.343 --> 43:58.552
Hey, isn't that Han Go-un?

43:58.636 --> 43:59.928
What's up with her face?

44:00.888 --> 44:01.847
Go-un?

44:02.681 --> 44:05.017
No. That's not it, Go-un.

44:05.100 --> 44:06.644
Hey, Go-un, is that--

44:08.354 --> 44:10.022
- Hey, look at her.
- Goodness.

44:10.105 --> 44:11.190
Who is she?

44:12.149 --> 44:14.276
- Hey!
- Go easy!

44:20.032 --> 44:21.075
Time out.

44:21.158 --> 44:23.494
Hey, Seo-jun.
Are you upset about something?

44:24.161 --> 44:25.663
- I don't know.
- Hold on.

44:25.746 --> 44:27.122
Don't leave. You're our front.

44:27.206 --> 44:29.208
- A front for what?
- You're our frontman.

44:29.291 --> 44:31.335
Girls line up when you're around.

44:31.418 --> 44:33.003
I'm gonna go see my baby.

44:33.087 --> 44:34.004
Who's your baby?

44:34.088 --> 44:35.005
Excuse me?

44:35.089 --> 44:37.633
- How do I play this?
- Who wants to throw water balloons?

44:41.011 --> 44:44.264
I'm not confident since it's my first time
doing someone else's makeup,

44:45.140 --> 44:46.266
but let's give it a try.

44:46.350 --> 44:49.728
We can't let those judgy girls
bring you down and ruin your performance.

44:49.812 --> 44:50.687
By the way…

44:51.814 --> 44:53.607
do I look that weird?

44:55.109 --> 44:56.193
You're pretty.

44:56.276 --> 44:59.488
You're pretty,
but let's touch it up a bit.

45:05.953 --> 45:08.247
Even just shaping your brows

45:08.330 --> 45:10.249
can make your features look more defined.

45:11.083 --> 45:13.585
Let's use a taupe-colored eyeshadow

45:14.169 --> 45:16.338
to create some depth.

45:17.506 --> 45:20.259
For a glamorous look suitable for a stage,

45:20.342 --> 45:22.094
I'll add some glitter.

45:36.984 --> 45:38.777
Don't be nervous, everyone.

45:38.861 --> 45:40.404
Take a deep breath, then…

45:42.197 --> 45:43.282
Everything's fine.

45:44.867 --> 45:47.619
By the way, where is Go-un? We're up next.

45:48.704 --> 45:52.166
Ma'am, I don't mind taking her place.

45:52.249 --> 45:53.417
Ma'am.

45:54.376 --> 45:55.586
I'm here.

45:59.214 --> 46:02.301
- This counts as volunteer work, right?
- That's why we're all here.

46:02.926 --> 46:04.553
You did say so.

46:05.262 --> 46:06.096
You're here.

46:06.722 --> 46:07.723
Enjoy the show.

46:07.806 --> 46:08.849
Whatever.

46:09.433 --> 46:10.476
Hi.

46:11.143 --> 46:13.896
- She's really pretty.
- What are you saying?

46:30.829 --> 46:31.914
Hey, who's that?

46:32.664 --> 46:34.833
I didn't know they had
such a pretty girl in the choir.

46:38.754 --> 46:42.966
- The world
- The world

46:43.509 --> 46:48.222
- Abandoned me
- Abandoned me

46:48.889 --> 46:53.894
- I wanted to believe
- I wanted to believe

46:53.977 --> 46:58.482
- I was all alone
- I was all alone

46:59.233 --> 47:04.154
- I knew it was
- I knew it was

47:04.238 --> 47:09.243
- My own misunderstanding
- My own misunderstanding

47:09.326 --> 47:14.665
- Something I knew
- Something I knew

47:14.748 --> 47:20.587
- But had always avoided
- But had always avoided

47:21.338 --> 47:26.134
Like a lone flower blossoming

47:26.718 --> 47:31.557
In a wide open field

47:31.640 --> 47:34.226
I've protected

47:34.309 --> 47:39.356
The feeling of emptiness

47:39.439 --> 47:42.317
Inside my heart

47:42.401 --> 47:47.239
- Like the sun coming out
- Like the sun coming out

47:47.322 --> 47:52.244
After heavy rain

47:52.327 --> 47:54.913
- My heart
- My heart

47:54.997 --> 47:58.166
- My surroundings
- My surroundings

47:58.250 --> 48:03.088
- I'm trying to illuminate it all
- I'm trying to illuminate it all

48:03.171 --> 48:08.385
- To the countless hands
- To the countless hands

48:08.468 --> 48:13.682
- That have uplifted me
- That have uplifted me

48:13.765 --> 48:16.727
Like the sun

48:16.810 --> 48:22.316
that illuminates me

48:23.275 --> 48:26.778
Become

48:27.529 --> 48:33.827
- A light
- A light

48:50.177 --> 48:51.762
Great work, everyone.

48:52.471 --> 48:54.640
You really proved your skills, Go-un.

48:54.723 --> 48:56.642
- You looked so pretty up there.
- Great job.

48:56.725 --> 48:57.851
Seriously.

48:58.352 --> 48:59.770
- You all did great.
- Ju-kyung!

49:00.437 --> 49:02.314
- Great work.
- Nice job.

49:02.397 --> 49:03.398
Ju-kyung.

49:04.024 --> 49:06.693
- That was seriously the best.
- Thank you so much.

49:06.777 --> 49:08.236
I didn't do anything.

49:09.029 --> 49:10.155
Hey!

49:12.532 --> 49:13.617
Seo-jun?

49:14.910 --> 49:16.912
You two know each other?

49:16.995 --> 49:18.413
How do you know my brother?

49:18.497 --> 49:19.539
Your brother?

49:20.749 --> 49:22.167
He's your brother?

49:23.502 --> 49:24.336
Ju-kyung!

49:24.878 --> 49:26.755
Ju-kyung, please help me out.

49:26.838 --> 49:28.715
Kangsu suddenly said she can't make it.

49:28.799 --> 49:30.342
- I need you.
- Sure.

49:30.425 --> 49:32.678
- See you around, Go-un.
- Yes, Ju-kyung.

49:34.638 --> 49:36.473
How do you know Ju-kyung?

49:39.559 --> 49:41.603
You look extra pretty today.

49:41.687 --> 49:43.313
Who are you trying to impress?

49:43.397 --> 49:44.314
Actually…

49:46.149 --> 49:48.026
No, I'll tell you later.

49:48.110 --> 49:49.986
What's this? You're being a tease.

49:52.364 --> 49:53.990
Here. Take it.

49:56.034 --> 49:57.869
- A pig?
- Why? You don't like it?

49:58.453 --> 49:59.746
Want to be the bunny instead?

50:00.455 --> 50:02.666
No. I like the pig costume.

50:02.749 --> 50:04.376
- I love it.
- What was that then?

50:04.459 --> 50:07.671
Get changed and head to the courts.
I'll go pick up some sports drinks.

50:07.754 --> 50:08.755
- Okay.
- See you later.

50:23.895 --> 50:24.813
You're here!

50:25.605 --> 50:28.024
How did you sleep? How do you feel?

50:28.608 --> 50:30.610
Remember the girl
I told you about yesterday?

50:30.694 --> 50:32.446
The girl who reminds me of the old me?

50:34.656 --> 50:35.866
Are you feeling all right?

50:38.285 --> 50:39.619
Did something happen?

50:43.457 --> 50:44.332
What's up with you?

50:45.667 --> 50:46.543
What?

50:47.294 --> 50:48.754
You said we'll go to the movies.

50:48.837 --> 50:50.255
Why would I watch a movie with you?

50:52.299 --> 50:53.800
- What?
- Don't kid yourself.

50:54.384 --> 50:56.303
I was only being nice
because I pitied you.

51:02.225 --> 51:03.101
Why would you…

51:04.311 --> 51:05.812
pity me?

51:08.940 --> 51:10.317
Because you know my secret?

51:12.736 --> 51:16.031
You found me pitiable for kneeling
and groveling at your feet?

51:16.615 --> 51:17.449
I did.

51:19.034 --> 51:22.704
That's why you told me I look pretty
and looked out for me.

51:23.955 --> 51:26.291
Just like looking after stray cats,
you pitied me.

51:26.374 --> 51:27.209
I did.

51:28.460 --> 51:30.378
But now it's bothersome and annoying.

51:31.630 --> 51:32.714
I no longer…

51:33.673 --> 51:36.009
want to care about you anymore, so leave.

51:38.220 --> 51:40.430
I never realized,
but you're meddlesome yourself.

51:41.431 --> 51:43.058
I never asked you to look after me.

51:43.892 --> 51:45.435
I never asked you to care for me.

51:47.103 --> 51:48.980
I won't bother you anymore,

51:50.273 --> 51:52.359
so you can stop your pity.

52:12.212 --> 52:15.215
It hasn't been long
since I've been living this dreamy life,

52:16.341 --> 52:17.676
yet I got too excited

52:17.759 --> 52:20.637
and went overboard,
dreaming of something I couldn't have.

52:21.638 --> 52:23.557
It was nothing but a meaningless dream.

52:24.307 --> 52:25.684
I'm so stupid.

52:43.910 --> 52:45.620
Don't use her because of me.

52:46.329 --> 52:47.622
What if I'm not using her?

52:48.582 --> 52:50.041
Then you mean it's for real?

52:50.667 --> 52:51.501
Why?

52:52.002 --> 52:53.628
Are you worried I might take her from you?

52:54.212 --> 52:56.339
I know you think Se-yeon died
because of me.

52:56.423 --> 52:58.091
That's not a thought. It's a fact.

52:58.174 --> 53:00.135
So how long will you take it out on me?

53:00.218 --> 53:01.303
Until you die…

53:02.846 --> 53:04.723
and meet Se-yeon again.

53:13.189 --> 53:14.024
I see.

53:15.692 --> 53:16.568
Does Ju-kyung know?

53:19.946 --> 53:21.364
That you killed your friend?

53:27.621 --> 53:29.331
What would she think of you
if she finds out?

53:32.584 --> 53:33.460
Never forget.

53:34.836 --> 53:36.463
You killed Se-yeon,

53:38.089 --> 53:39.674
and you don't deserve to smile.

53:41.301 --> 53:42.636
You murderer.

53:55.774 --> 53:57.692
- I like blue.
- Blue?

53:57.776 --> 53:59.027
- What about you?
- I'll get…

53:59.110 --> 54:01.321
- No, it's mine.
- Does it look good?

54:02.572 --> 54:04.282
- Want to play a game?
- Want to play a game?

54:05.700 --> 54:07.786
No. Let's just go.

54:07.869 --> 54:09.162
Let's go.

54:11.039 --> 54:13.667
Hey, is this really necessary?

54:13.750 --> 54:15.961
If we do this, it'll cheer up Seo-jun.

54:16.044 --> 54:18.213
- All right.
- I feel like he'll get more upset.

54:18.296 --> 54:21.591
- The game will start soon. Let's go.
- Come on, let's go!

54:22.092 --> 54:24.302
- Go, Saebom Devils!
- Go, Saebom Devils!

54:24.386 --> 54:27.931
- Go, Saebom Devils!
- Go, Han Seo-jun!

54:33.436 --> 54:35.188
That's right! Seo-jun Almighty!

54:35.271 --> 54:37.899
- He's not on our team.
- I'm sorry.

54:37.983 --> 54:39.359
By the way, where's Lee Soo-ho?

54:39.901 --> 54:41.403
No idea. Maybe he's not here yet.

54:45.240 --> 54:47.867
What? You're here?
You said you had tutoring today.

54:47.951 --> 54:49.327
I skipped and snuck out.

54:54.791 --> 54:56.584
Limju, what took you so long? Come on.

54:59.170 --> 55:01.297
Go, my super handsome Tae-hoon!

55:03.299 --> 55:05.969
- Han Seo-jun!
- Han Seo-jun!

55:39.044 --> 55:42.297
SAEBOM DEVILS

56:01.316 --> 56:02.525
SAEBOM UNION

57:44.169 --> 57:45.086
Soo-ho!

57:56.931 --> 57:57.765
You were right.

57:59.392 --> 58:01.769
It's all because of me,
and it's all my fault.

58:03.104 --> 58:05.231
So you can take it out on me all you want.

58:05.315 --> 58:06.733
I'll take it.

58:10.361 --> 58:11.237
But

58:12.030 --> 58:13.740
don't play Lim Ju-kyung.

58:16.451 --> 58:17.827
I won't hold back then.

58:33.801 --> 58:39.182
THE EIGHTH ANNUAL SAEBOM FESTIVAL
A NIGHT OF CELEBRATION

58:39.265 --> 58:43.520
I'm too generous in love…

58:44.312 --> 58:45.396
Hey, Limju!

58:46.022 --> 58:47.607
Shall we sit in the front or back?

58:48.191 --> 58:49.651
I feel a little tired, so…

58:49.734 --> 58:52.153
Don't say you're leaving.

58:52.237 --> 58:55.198
The party's just getting started.
Where do you think you're going?

58:55.281 --> 58:57.951
Let's all leave after the concert.
Come on.

58:58.034 --> 58:59.202
Let's sit over there.

59:00.036 --> 59:02.956
While we drunkenly dance together

59:03.039 --> 59:08.878
Everything falls out of my pockets

59:08.962 --> 59:13.132
But I'm still fine…

59:13.216 --> 59:15.593
The next song is not well known,

59:15.677 --> 59:18.513
but it's from the late Jeong Se-yeon,
of whom I was a huge fan.

59:18.596 --> 59:20.807
In memory of Se-yeon,
who left us a year ago,

59:20.890 --> 59:22.350
I dedicate this song to him.

59:22.433 --> 59:27.438
Because I can't yet forget…

59:27.522 --> 59:28.356
Jeong Se-yeon?

59:29.107 --> 59:32.318
Hey, that's the guy
who took his own life last year.

59:32.402 --> 59:33.695
Right.

59:34.737 --> 59:36.614
Why did they have to pick this song?

59:36.698 --> 59:39.284
I bet Seo-jun will start
another fight with Soo-ho.

59:39.367 --> 59:41.744
Why? Did he have something
to do with Jeong Se-yeon?

59:41.828 --> 59:43.037
Those three were close.

59:43.121 --> 59:45.498
Lee Soo-ho, Han Seo-jun,
and Jeong Se-yeon.

59:45.582 --> 59:48.334
- Did Soo-ho never mention that?
- What?

59:48.418 --> 59:49.544
Right, they were.

59:49.627 --> 59:51.754
Now that I think of it, I think they were.

59:52.547 --> 59:55.383
I live and forget

59:55.967 --> 59:58.344
Pretending I'm fine

59:58.428 --> 01:00:02.181
I even meet with people

01:00:03.766 --> 01:00:06.311
At a certain point

01:00:06.978 --> 01:00:10.481
This bitter longing 

01:00:10.565 --> 01:00:15.236
Became a habit

01:00:17.614 --> 01:00:18.698
SE-YEON

01:00:18.781 --> 01:00:20.450
ARE YOU DONE WITH PRACTICE?

01:00:21.117 --> 01:00:24.704
Reporter Choi, Mr. Lee is too busy
to be dating these days.

01:00:26.039 --> 01:00:28.458
He just had a few drinks
after the shoot, that's all.

01:00:29.125 --> 01:00:32.128
What do you mean by prostitution?
That's absurd.

01:00:33.338 --> 01:00:34.631
Of course not.

01:00:49.187 --> 01:00:55.943
JEONG SE-YEON

01:01:18.549 --> 01:01:21.678
- I heard Jeong Se-yeon killed himself.
- From the boy band? Goodness.

01:01:22.679 --> 01:01:24.514
- You can't come in.
- Please leave.

01:01:53.793 --> 01:01:56.796
How are you doing?

01:01:56.879 --> 01:02:03.261
I guess I'm not doing well

01:02:04.053 --> 01:02:10.685
I'm stuck here without you
But I'm not alone

01:02:10.768 --> 01:02:15.189
On an island of regret…

01:02:15.273 --> 01:02:17.734
- I have to go.
- What?

01:02:17.817 --> 01:02:20.987
I didn't know the end would come

01:02:21.070 --> 01:02:25.575
I didn't even know what love was

01:02:26.325 --> 01:02:30.913
A world in which I can't hold you

01:02:30.997 --> 01:02:32.874
Or see you…

01:02:32.957 --> 01:02:34.292
Soo-ho.

01:02:52.560 --> 01:02:53.394
Are you all right?

01:02:55.354 --> 01:02:56.189
Leave.

01:02:58.483 --> 01:02:59.692
I said, leave!

01:03:32.517 --> 01:03:34.936
- Take off your jacket.
- It's chilly.

01:03:35.019 --> 01:03:36.896
- It's so cold.
- Give me your jacket.

01:03:36.979 --> 01:03:39.190
How do you know Ju-kyung?

01:03:39.273 --> 01:03:40.233
Well,

01:03:41.067 --> 01:03:43.736
she helped me out when I was in trouble.

01:03:44.737 --> 01:03:48.366
If weren't for her,
I probably couldn't have sung on stage.

01:03:48.449 --> 01:03:50.535
She even did my makeup.

01:03:50.618 --> 01:03:51.786
Don't I look good?

01:03:51.869 --> 01:03:53.246
Don't play Lim Ju-kyung.

01:03:54.956 --> 01:03:56.499
I won't hold back then.

01:03:56.582 --> 01:03:57.875
It's too cold.

01:03:57.959 --> 01:04:01.295
Seo-jun, what are you thinking about?

01:04:01.379 --> 01:04:03.631
You were thinking about that girl,
weren't you?

01:04:03.714 --> 01:04:04.966
No.

01:04:06.968 --> 01:04:08.261
I haven't been considerate.

01:04:08.845 --> 01:04:09.679
What?

01:04:12.473 --> 01:04:13.599
I feel sorry…

01:04:14.725 --> 01:04:16.102
for no reason.

01:04:18.437 --> 01:04:20.064
- Hey, wait up!
- Where are you going?

01:04:22.316 --> 01:04:24.485
- You're going to come like this?
- Han Seo-jun.

01:04:24.569 --> 01:04:26.571
All our clothes got wet because of you.

01:04:26.654 --> 01:04:28.656
- We got all wet.
- We even cheered for you!

01:04:28.739 --> 01:04:29.574
Don't follow me.

01:04:30.241 --> 01:04:33.119
If you follow me, you're dead.
I'm telling you now.

01:04:33.202 --> 01:04:35.663
- Why not?
- But I love you, Seo-jun!

01:04:44.130 --> 01:04:46.382
So he was a friend of Jeong Se-yeon.

01:04:49.760 --> 01:04:51.554
What happened to him earlier?

01:04:52.638 --> 01:04:54.223
Was he not feeling well?

01:05:06.235 --> 01:05:09.238
Whatever. It's none of my business.

01:05:20.708 --> 01:05:22.168
Are you asleep, Ju-kyung?

01:05:23.169 --> 01:05:24.170
No.

01:05:24.754 --> 01:05:26.839
Then wash up before bed,
even if you're tired.

01:05:27.548 --> 01:05:28.466
Got it?

01:05:32.678 --> 01:05:33.721
He's right.

01:05:35.389 --> 01:05:37.850
I should at least remove my makeup
before going to bed.

01:05:50.363 --> 01:05:52.031
Where have I seen this before?

01:06:04.335 --> 01:06:05.836
That time on the rooftop…

01:06:16.305 --> 01:06:17.598
That man was…

01:06:21.394 --> 01:06:22.853
Lee Soo-ho?

01:06:26.232 --> 01:06:27.441
Did someone you know

01:06:28.818 --> 01:06:30.903
jump from a rooftop?

01:06:32.905 --> 01:06:36.158
We don't even know each other,
but you saved me and got so angry.

01:06:36.242 --> 01:06:38.786
That's why I wondered
if someone close to you had died.

01:06:49.255 --> 01:06:51.590
Haven't you thought of
the people you'd leave behind

01:06:52.842 --> 01:06:54.677
and how much they would grieve?

01:06:55.344 --> 01:06:58.806
Someone out there
might suffer forever with guilt

01:06:59.598 --> 01:07:01.767
for failing to save you.

01:07:03.561 --> 01:07:06.731
There's nothing you can do
for a dead person.

01:07:08.524 --> 01:07:09.608
So don't do it.

01:09:01.178 --> 01:09:02.263
It was here…

01:09:05.224 --> 01:09:06.183
From here…

01:09:09.186 --> 01:09:10.437
Se-yeon…

01:09:14.525 --> 01:09:15.401
I know.

01:09:16.110 --> 01:09:17.111
Se-yeon…

01:09:23.033 --> 01:09:23.951
I know.

01:09:25.786 --> 01:09:27.121
I understand.

01:10:43.322 --> 01:10:45.157
Someone told me

01:10:45.241 --> 01:10:48.035
that tears cleanse the heart.

01:10:49.370 --> 01:10:51.455
A friend of Jeong Se-yeon,

01:10:51.538 --> 01:10:52.790
and the son of Lee Ju-hun.

01:10:52.873 --> 01:10:54.917
Why does he have so many secrets?

01:10:56.377 --> 01:10:58.337
You're home, sweetie?

01:10:59.380 --> 01:11:01.382
You are so awesome.

01:11:01.465 --> 01:11:04.385
This is Han Seo-jun's girlfriend?

01:11:05.094 --> 01:11:07.888
Why? Did you help me again
because you pitied me?

01:11:07.972 --> 01:11:09.306
It was them, right?

01:11:09.974 --> 01:11:11.267
You must've been so shocked.

01:11:12.559 --> 01:11:16.897
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
